'''Emerald''' is a {{Common}} collection item that can be obtained by mining {{Item|Emerald Ore}}.

== Collection ==
Collecting emeralds increases the player's emerald [[Collections|collection]], which grants useful items and perks upon collecting certain amounts of emeralds.

{{/Collection_UI}}
{{CollectionTable|Emerald}}

== Obtaining ==
=== Natural Generation ===
Emerald ore spawns naturally in {{zone|Slimehill}}, {{zone|Dwarven Mines}} and {{zone|Crystal Hollows}}.

Mining emerald ore gives grants +7{{Skl|Mining}} XP.

=== Bazaar ===
'''Emerald''' can be bought from the [[Bazaar]] for {{BZC|1 EMERALD}}.

